DESCRIPTION:Topic\n\nBuilding Career Resilience through Upskilling & Reskil
	ling\n\nSynopsis\n\nInculcate growth mindset\, learn about the Triple E fr
	amework\, career lattice\, ecosystem and tools to support your career deve
	lopment\n\nSpeaker\n\nKunal PUNJABI kunalpunjabi@dbs.com <mailto:kunalpunj
	abi@dbs.com>  \;  Abhilash DUGGYALA abhilashrao@dbs.com <mailto:abhilashra
	o@dbs.com> \n\n \n\n\n\n__________________________________________________
	____________________________________________________________\n\nOption 1 
	– If you are joining via a laptop or mobile device through the applicati
	on:\n1. Click on this hyperlink: Webex Meeting Link <https://dbs.webex.com
	/dbs/j.php?MTID=m97c7c55f1739e19ddda8e1d3693df74b> \n2. Use a headset for 
	a better experience\n*Visit here <https://dbs1bank.sharepoint.com/sites/sg
	FOW/SitePages/fow/digital-tools.aspx?market=Singapore&category=Communicati
	on> to find out more about Webex \n\nMeeting password: YStTxJAW735 (only i
	f asked)\n\nOption 2 – If you are joining via Cisco VC Equipment:\nUse t
	he Touch Panel to dial in\n1. Press the "Call" icon\n2. Dial 25148448390@d
	bs.webex.com <mailto:25148448390@dbs.webex.com>  into the search bar and p
	ress "Call" \n3. If you are the host\, enter your 6-digit one-time Host KE
	Y. Click here to see how to retrieve your Host KEY <https://dbs1bank.share
	point.com/sites/sgFOW/Shared%20Documents/Forms/AllItems.aspx?viewpath=%2Fs
	ites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents&id=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents
	%2FGuides%2FWebEx%2FUser%20Guide%5FHost%5FPIN%2Epdf&viewid=1b23a731%2D8c47
	%2D42f0%2Dbd84%2Db790e52deffa&parent=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents
	%2FGuides%2FWebEx> \n\nOption 3 – If you are joining via a laptop throug
	h the Web browser: \nFor external parties who do not wish to download the 
	application \n1. Click on this hyperlink: Webex Meeting Link <https://dbs.
	webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=m97c7c55f1739e19ddda8e1d3693df74b> \n2. Click on 
	‘Cancel button’ if a popup ‘Open Webex?' appears \n3. Click on ‘Jo
	in from your browser’ \n4. Enter your Name and Email Address and join th
	e meeting \n\nClick here <https://help.webex.com/en-us/article/nrbgeodb/Jo
	in-a-Webex-Meeting#id_135013> to find out more\n\nOption 4 – If you are 
	dialling in via phone (audio only):\n*Toll charges / Long distance charges
	 may apply.\nNote if you are the host\, please use either Option 1 or 2 to
	 start the meeting.\nSingapore +65-3157-6442 <tel:%2B65-3157-6442\,\,1%23\
	,%23> \nHong Kong +852-3018-6828 <tel:%2B852-3018-6828\,\,1%23\,%23> \nInd
	ia\, Mumbai +91-22-6480-0114 <tel:%2B91-22-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia
	\, Hyderabad +91-40-6480-0114 <tel:%2B91-40-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nTaiw
	an +886-2-5594-0839 <tel:%2B886-2-5594-0839\,\,1%23\,%23> \n\nMeeting Numb
	er: 2514 844 8390#\nGlobal call-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/glob
	alcallin.php> \n\n\nUseful Links:\nNeed help? Contact Webex Support Team! 
	<mailto:webexsupport@dbs.com> \n\n \n\n
